NAME
       users - print the names of the users logged in now

SYNOPSIS
       users

DESCRIPTION
       users prints one line with the login names of everyone who is logged
       in, sorted. A name appears once for each session, so a user with two
       terminals may appear twice. For more detail use who or w.

EXAMPLES
           users

SEE ALSO
       who(1), w(1), whoami(1)
